# Screen data for the case decks: what the ventilator, monitor and bedside show at each stage (from the CP ventilator
# script and the rapid-cases deck), short slide wording for each order (label, consequence), and the theory slides to weave in.
# Order text and full responses come from the app (CASES[id].live) so the phone and the slide always match.

def S(**k): return k

